+
+## Delta decisions
+
+| check | decision | independent concrete result |
+|---|---|---|
+| repaired literal-stderr semantics | **CONFIRMED** | The pinned actual stdout was accepted with `b''`; the same bytes with stderr `b" \n\t"` were rejected as `nonempty stderr`. |
